  root_cause:
    "A0-S4-CANARY: The S4 analysis layer (Qwen via Ollama on LXC 101) produced an empty first_action
     field in its s4-analysis output. Root cause was a 3-factor stacked failure (commit 7cc9672):
       1. RAM downsize: LXC 101 was reduced from 8G→1G on Jun 26 (planned rebalancing) which
          starved Ollama of memory.
       2. Timeout: Qwen's response generation was timing out before producing a complete analysis.
       3. Context overflow: Even when Qwen did respond, the context window was too tight for the
          full analysis, resulting in truncated output with empty first_action.
     Fix (Jul 1): RAM restored to 8192 MB, timeout increased, context window lobotomy to reduce
     token pressure. After the fix, Qwen consistently produces complete s4-analysis entries.
     The single pending signal is from Jul 6 (the last event before full recovery). The 3 acked
     signals from Jun 27-30 were the initial outage period.",

  fix_sha_and_date: [
    "e336269 — A0-S4-CANARY root cause documentation (2026-07-01)",
    "7cc9672 — fix(a0-s4): revive S4 semantic layer — RAM + timeout + ctx lobotomy (2026-07-01)",
  ],

  zero_recurrence:
