     restoration on 101 (Jul 1) double-insure against recurrence.",

  recommendation: {
    action:    "ACK_WITH_EVIDENCE — ack the single pending row (4 signals duped). Evidence: RAM
                restored Jul 1, Ollama migrated to LXC 110 Jul 13, no recurrence in 5.5 days.
                The 3 older acked rows show the outage was already known and handled.",
    rationale: "Qwen is healthy on LXC 110. The 4 duplicated signals are a historical artifact
                from the last moment of the outage. No recurrence expected.",
